menu "ZaruBall Local Features"

config ZMK_TRACKBALL_ACCEL_PROCESSOR
    bool "Enable ZaruBall trackball acceleration input processor"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_POINTING
    help
      Adds a local input processor that applies dynamic acceleration to
      physical trackball X/Y events before they are emitted as HID reports.

config ZMK_TRACKBALL_ACCEL_MAX_INPUT_DEVICES
    int "Maximum input devices sharing one accel processor instance"
    default 4
    depends on ZMK_TRACKBALL_ACCEL_PROCESSOR
    range 1 8
    help
      The number of input listeners that can safely share one accel
      processor instance. One is enough for the current ZaruBall setup.

endmenu
